{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "460e5185-cac9-8746-9ed1-20351669605c",
  "created_at": "2026-01-02T11:55:08-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tariq Goldberg",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:52:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Happy New Year, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:52:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happy New Year to you. Well, I'm still here, so that's a start. Listen, I hope I'm calling the right office. It's about a storm drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:52:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're in the right place, storm drains are ours. What's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:52:37-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm calling for my mother. She's in her eighties, she lives on Mill Street, and the drain out front of the house is, I don't know how else to say it, grunting. It's slow, it gurgles, and any time we get a thaw the water backs up into the street and just sits there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:52:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And what's the address on Mill Street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:52:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "330 Mill Street. Up in the Historic Hill part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:53:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "330 Mill Street. Got it. And is this from a storm, or just from melting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:53:09-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No storm. Nothing. It's dry out, sun's out today. It's just the thaw, the snow melts off the roofs and the drain can't take it. It backs up and the water sits there for hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:53:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. So dry weather, melting snow, and the drain is slow to take it. Is it getting in the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:53:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not today. It comes up to the edge of her walk. But I'll tell you, it was not this bad last winter. Last year it drained fine. Something's changed with it, it's clogged or collapsed or I don't know what."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:53:43-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's helpful to know, that it's new this year. Let me make sure I have it right. 330 Mill Street, the drain in front of the house, slow and backing up whenever it thaws, worse than last winter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:53:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly. So will somebody open a work order? And can you tell me for what date? I'd like to be able to tell my mother something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:54:06-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll open a work order now. As for the date, I don't see a crew schedule from where I sit. After the holiday there's a backlog, so I'd say they'd look at it sometime in the next week or so. Can I get a callback number in case they want to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:54:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0176."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:54:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0176. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:54:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tariq Goldberg. G-O-L-D-B-E-R-G."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:54:30-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Goldberg. I've got the work order going for the storm drain at 330 Mill Street, slow and backing up on thaws, no storm involved. I'll note it as ongoing and worse than last year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:54:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'd hate for it to turn into ice out there, she walks that sidewalk. It's been going on a few weeks now and I figured it was time to call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:54:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. If it freezes over before they get there, call us back and we'll add that to the order."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:55:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks, Lorraine. You have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:55:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Goldberg. Take care."
    }
  ],
